### Use with the "REST Client" extension (click "Send Request"). Start the server first.

### Server info
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/info

### Submit a ticket (returns a run_id)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Add a clamp utility", "description": "Create clamp(value, low, high) and reject inverted bounds." }

### List runs
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/runs

### Run details + full trace (paste a run id)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID

### Approve a run that is awaiting approval
POST http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/runs/PASTE_RUN_ID/decision
Content-Type: application/json

{ "approved": true, "note": "reviewed in VS Code" }

### Latest eval scorecard
GET http://127.0.0.1:8765/api/evals
